# Locale redirects for un-prefixed entry paths. Handled by Cloudflare at the CDN
# edge (before the Worker), so they work regardless of the Astro/adapter version
# and the middleware-in-prod bug (withastro/astro#15463). Bare paths go to the
# default locale (en); "/" still detects the visitor's locale via src/pages/index.astro.
# Exact paths only (no wildcard) so image assets under /docs/... are never touched.
/flash                  /en/flash/                  302
/docs                   /en/docs/                   302
/docs/overview          /en/docs/overview/          302
/docs/compatibility     /en/docs/compatibility/     302
/docs/hardware          /en/docs/hardware/          302
/docs/wiring            /en/docs/wiring/            302
/docs/flashing          /en/docs/flashing/          302
/docs/setup             /en/docs/setup/             302
/docs/web-ui            /en/docs/web-ui/            302
/docs/status-led        /en/docs/status-led/        302
/docs/troubleshooting   /en/docs/troubleshooting/   302
